  "notes": "Henan Shuanghui Investment & Development Co Ltd (SZSE: 000895) \u2014 China's largest pork processor. ~73% owned by WH Group (HK-listed Smithfield parent). Vertically integrated meat-processing, packaged meats, fresh pork, and downstream meat distribution. Reports CNY-millions PRC GAAP. Lists in CNY on Shenzhen Stock Exchange. FY ends Dec 31. Asset-light vs upstream pork producers (Muyuan / New Hope Liuhe) \u2014 Shuanghui is processor/marketer, not large-scale farm operator. Modest leverage. Revenue down vs FY20 peak as China hog cycle and consumer demand softened. High-payout dividend stock \u2014 known for distributing >90% of net income via H1 + H2 cash dividends.",
